‎Pray for righteousness, peace and salvation to the ends of the earth, that the lord’s will be manifested in the nations of the world. Declare that leaders are yielded to the word of God, making decision and policies that favor the gospel of Christ.
‎Declare, cutting off all evil influences over leaders, affirming that all rulers submit to the lordship of Christ and the light of God’s Word shines brightly throughout the whole world and darkness cannot comprehend it. Hallelujah.   ', '2', 't', '2026-08-10 11:28:14.802409+00', '2026-08-10 11:28:54.793+00', 'f'),
  ('20f1f89b-61f7-48fe-a13b-94298bf13e8b', 'PRAYER POINT 3  FOR THE WEEK, 10TH AUGUST, 2026.', '‎PRAY FOR MINISTERS AND THEIR MINISTRIES THAT THEY PROGRESS WITHOUT LIMITATION.', '

‎Thessalonians 3:1 – “Pray for us, that the word of the Lord may run swiftly, and be glorified…” Philippians 1:12 – “…the things which happened unto me have fallen out rather unto the furtherance of the gospel.”', '
PRAYER POINT 3


‎Pray for ministers of the Gospel and their ministries all around the world. Declare supernatural advancement, unhindered growth, and limitless progress in every aspect of their calling and assignment.
‎Declare multiple grace upon them, causing their impact to increase and their influence to spread far and wide. Strengthen them with might by the Spirit in the inner man, that they may walk in boldness, wisdom, and divine direction at all times. Removing every barrier, limitation, and opposition that seeks to hinder their effectiveness.
‎Decree that their ministries flourish like a well-watered garden, bearing abundant and lasting fruits of righteousness. Doors of utterance be opened continually, and the Word of God grow mightily and prevail through them. Causing them to move from glory to glory, fulfilling their divine mandate with excellence and power. Thank the Lord, for His Spirit at work in them, producing outstanding results and establishing their works in righteousness, in Jesus’ Name. Amen.', '3', 't', '2026-08-10 11:31:30.85487+00', '2026-08-10 11:31:30.85487+00', 'f'),
  ('4e5c05ad-623e-4cc4-9f12-780c970c2185', 'PRAYER POINTS FOR THE WEEK, 3RD- 10TH AUGUST, 2026.', 'PRAY FOR PEACE, PROSPERITY, AND PROGRESS IN EVERY NATION.', '‎Genesis 26:13 - And the man waxed great, and went forward, and grew until he became very great! ', '‎PRAYER POINT 1 – 00:00AM TO 10:00 GMT+1
‎PRAY FOR PEACE, PROSPERITY, AND PROGRESS IN EVERY NATION.

‎1 Timothy 2:1–2 (KJV) “I exhort therefore, that, first of all, supplications, prayers, intercessions, and giving of thanks, be made for all men; For kings, and for all that are in authority; that we may lead a quiet and peaceable life in all godliness and honesty. 
‎
‎Pray fervently in the spirit, thanking God for his divine authority and righteousness that prevails over all the nations of the earth. Declare peace, stability, progress and prosperity in our nations. Decree that every plan of darkness against the nations is frustrated, and God’s purpose alone stands, righteousness shine through every system and structure, bringing transformation, unity, and progress. 
‎
‎


‎PRAYER POINT 2 - 00:10AM TO 00:19AM GMT+1                 
PRAY FOR MINISTERS AND THEIR MINISTRIES THAT THEIR WORKS EXCEL AND EXPAND BEYOND BORDERS BY GOD''S GRACE.

‎1 Corinthians 2:1,4,says, ''And I, brethren, when I came to you, came not with excellency of speech or of wisdom, declaring unto you the testimony of God... And my speech and my preaching was not with enticing words of man''s wisdom, but in demonstration of the Spirit and of power: That your faith should not stand in the wisdom of men, but in the power of God.
‎
‎Thank God for his grace and calling upon every minister of the Gospel around the world. Declare that they are strengthened, empowered, and guided by the Holy Spirit in all that they do, preaching the Gospel with power, accuracy, and conviction, bringing salvation, healing, and transformation to multitudes. Declare that their ministries flourish and expand on every side. Granting them supernatural increase, divine provision, and open doors for greater impact, their labor produce lasting fruits, and their works stand the test of time. 
‎
‎


‎PRAYER POINT 3: -00:20AM to 00:29AM GMT+1           
PRAY, THANKING GOD FOR RETENTION OF SOULS, HEALING AND SALVATION FROM THE JUST CONCLUDED HEALING STREAMS LIVE HEALING SERVICES WITH PASTOR CHRIS.

‎Psalm 107:8,9 says, ''Oh men would praise the LORD for his goodness, and for his wonderful works tothe children of men! For he satisfieth the longing soul, and filleth the hungry soul with goodness''.


‎
‎Psalm 107:15,16 says, ''Oh that men wouldpraise the LORD for his goodness, and for his wonderful works to the children of men! For he hath broken the gates of brass, and cut the bars of iron in sunder''.
‎
‎Give praise and thanks to the Lord for all  that He did at the just concluded Healing Streams Live Healing Services: Give him praise for the blessings, miracles, healings, testimonies and transformations that took place across the nations of the world. Thank the lord for restoring lives, mending broken bodies, and bringing hope, joy, and strength to multitudes. Praise him for the salvation of souls and the testimonies that continue to abound.



‎Declare that the impact of this program abides and multiplies. Every healing be permanent, and every testimony spread abroad, drawing more souls into the Kingdom. Pray for all who participated, that they remain established in the Word and walk continually in divine health and victory. Thank the lord for his servant (Rev Chris Oyahkilome) and for the global spread of the Gospel.




‎
‎PRAYER POINT 4 - 00:30AM TO 00:39AM GMT+1
PRAY FOR THE SUCCESSFUL ORGANIZATION OF THE ISM MINISTERS AND LEADERS CONFERENCES.
‎Matthew 9:37–38 (KJV) -“Then saith he unto his disciples, the harvest truly is plenteous, but the labourers are few; Pray ye therefore the Lord of the harvest, that he will send forth labourers into his harvest.”
Proverbs 16:3 -"Commit thy works unto the Lord, and thy thoughts shall be established."
‎
‎Pray concerning the successful organization of the ISM Ministers and Leaders Conferences. Proclaim that all aspects of the planning and execution are established according to God’s perfect will and purpose (Proverbs 16:3). 
‎
‎Declare that God''s Word will be taught with power and confirmed with signs, wonders, miracles, and lasting testimonies. Decree that the conferences shall fully accomplish its divine purpose, producing unprecedented results, raising effective laborers for the kingdom, and advancing the Gospel globally, in the Name of the Lord Jesus.
‎

