  ('eefb75e1-6d85-44b3-80d4-5bd98447c26c', 'PRAYER POINT 4  FOR THE WEEK, 10TH AUGUST, 2026.', 'PRAY FOR THE MIGHTY SUCCESS OF THE ONGOING ISM MINISTERS AND LEADERS CONFERENCE.', '
