‎Ephesians 4:11–12…He gave some to be apostles… pastors and teachers, for the equipping of the saints…”
', 'PRAYER POINT 4 - 00:30 AM to 00:39 AM GMT+1                                                                                                                                ‎
‎Pray for the mighty success of the ongoing ISM Ministers’ and Leaders’ Conferences. Declaring that, the presence of God be powerfully manifested in every session, bringing divine wisdom, insight, and transformation to all who attend.
‎Declare that every minister and leader will be empowered, refreshed, and equipped for greater works. As there will be an outpouring of the Spirit, resulting in growth, unity, supernatural, advancement and progression in every area of ministry.
‎Proclaim that the conferences will be a resounding success in every city, nation, country, or region that it holds touching lives and advancing the work of the Kingdom mightily.', '4', 't', '2026-08-10 11:34:11.835722+00', '2026-08-10 11:34:11.835722+00', 'f'),
  ('3c8962e2-d879-42f3-93f8-efcea4608db6', 'PRAYER POINT 2  FOR THE WEEK, 10TH AUGUST, 2026.', 'PRAY FOR ENLIGHTENMENT IN THE HEARTS OF YOUTH AND TEENS OF THIS GENERATION.', '‎Ephesians 1:17–18 – “…that the God of our Lord Jesus Christ… may give unto you the spirit of wisdom and revelation… the eyes of your understanding being enlightened…”
‎1 Timothy 4:12:15 – “…be thou an example of the believers… Meditate upon these things… that thy profiting may appear to all.”', 'PRAYER POINT 2 - 00:10 AM to 00:19 AM GMT+1                                                                                        
‎

‎
‎Pray effectively, lifting up the youth and teens of this generation before the lord, that their eyes of understanding be enlightened, that they may know the lord and walk in the fullness of his purpose for their lives. Causing his light to shine brightly in their hearts, dispelling every form of darkness, confusion, and deception. Granting them wisdom, knowledge, and spiritual understanding to make the right choices that aligns with God’s perfect will.
‎Declare supernatural progression in every area of their lives—academically, spiritually, mentally, and socially. They move forward with clarity, excellence, and divine direction. Their paths shine brighter and brighter, leading them into greater glory and impact.
‎', '1', 't', '2026-08-10 11:26:39.63584+00', '2026-08-10 11:29:18.904+00', 't'),
  ('c9fa6653-ce76-4429-a2b9-58f64b9a8ef6', 'Test', 'Sister Ebun', 'Amen', 'I just created thisone, sister ebun', '5', 'f', '2026-08-17 16:53:06.327383+00', '2026-08-17 16:53:06.327383+00', 'f'),
  ('1ac74fe8-48fd-4c4f-ad21-0f645a8a391f', 'PRAYER POINTS FOR THE WEEK, STARTING FROM MONDAY 17TH- AUGUST, 2026.', '‎PRAYER POINT 1 – 00:00 AM TO 00:09 AM GMT+1                                                                                                         PRAY FOR POLITICAL LEADERS AND FOR ALL THOSE IN AUTHORITY IN ALL NATIONS.', '1Timothy 2:1 - I exhort therefore, that, first of all, supplications, prayers, intercessions, and giving of thanks, be made for all men, For kings, and for all that are in authority; that we may lead a quiet and peaceable life in all godliness and honesty. For this is good and acceptable in the sight of God our Savior.
‎Proverbs 21:1 - The king''s heart is in the hand of the LORD, as the rivers of water: he turned it whithersoever he will.   Every way of a man is right in his own eyes: but the LORD pondered the hearts.
‎', 'Pray for the salvation of political leaders and for those in position of authority in all nations of the world, that the knowledge of God''s Word fills their hearts and turns them into righteousness. Declare that they have the wisdom, understanding, righteousness, and sound judgment to lead with justice and integrity. Declare that every decision they make is inspired by God and produces peace, progress, stability, and prosperity for their nations. Pray that every counsel and agenda that seeks to bring division, violence, corruption, or destruction is frustrated.  
‎', '6', 't', '2026-08-17 17:39:44.385984+00', '2026-08-17 17:39:44.385984+00', 'f'),
  ('a2e7999c-a9bc-4595-b001-aa2baf46eb67', '‎PRAYER POINT 2  FOR THE WEEK, STARTING FROM MONDAY 17TH- AUGUST, 2026.', 'PRAY FOR PROGRESSION FOR MINISTERS AND THEIR MINISTRIES AROUND THE WORLD.', '‎1Corinthians 15.57 - But thanks be to God, which give us the victory through our Lord Jesus Christ. Therefore, my beloved brethren, be ye steadfast, unmovable, always abounding in the work of the Lord, forasmuch as ye know that your labor is not in vain in the Lord.
‎2 Peter 3:18 - But grow in grace, and in the knowledge of our Lord and Savior Jesus Christ. To him be glory both now and forever. Amen.
‎', '‎Pray for ministers and their ministries around the world, that they continually advance in spiritual growth, wisdom, knowledge, and ministerial capacity. Declare that every minister increases in the revelation of God’s Word, the power of the Spirit, and the ability to effectively fulfil the assignment committed to them, causing their ministries to experience continual progress, expansion, impact, and outstanding results. ‎', '7', 't', '2026-08-17 17:41:46.389413+00', '2026-08-17 17:41:46.389413+00', 'f'),
  ('3bf83034-c672-4145-b99e-158887cadeac', '‎PRAYER POINT 3  FOR THE WEEK, STARTING FROM MONDAY 17TH- AUGUST, 2026.', 'PRAY FOR INSTITUTIONS OF LEARNING, FOR CHILDREN AND YOUTHS.', '
‎Daniel 1:17; as for these four children, God gave them knowledge and skill in all learning and wisdom: and Daniel had understanding in all visions and dreams. (KJV)
‎Isaiah 54:13 - And all thy children shall be taught of the LORD; and great shall be the peace of thy children.', 'Pray for schools and institutions of learning around the world, that they will be established as centers of excellence, knowledge, discipline, and godly influence. Pray for children and youths, that they will receive sound education, develop wisdom and understanding, and excel in their academic pursuits. Declare that their minds be enlightened, their talents and abilities be developed, and they’ll grow mightily in wisdom, stature, and favor with God and with men.', '8', 't', '2026-08-17 17:43:14.404264+00', '2026-08-17 17:43:14.404264+00', 'f'),
  ('7f03fd10-e586-47e3-b604-fe75be2721ef', 'PRAYER POINT 4  FOR AUGUST MONDAY, 17TH AUGUST, 2026.', 'PRAY FOR ISM MINISTERS AND LEADERS CONFERENCE AND ALL UPCOMING ISM PROGRAMS ', '‎2 Corinthians 9:8 - And God is able to make all grace abound toward you; that ye, always having all sufficiency in all things, may abound to every good work. 
‎Isaiah 45:8 - Drop down, ye heavens, from above, and let the skies pour down righteousness: let the earth open, and let them bring forth salvation, and let righteousness spring up together; I the LORD have created it.', '‎Pray that all ISM Ministers and leaders conference and all upcoming ISM programs will be impactful,  successful, with the power of God prevailing in every meeting and many ministers being reached, strengthened, equipped, and established in the Word. Declare that every preparation towards every program will be marked by divine supernatural intervention, and that the programs will produce lasting impact for the Kingdom of God. Pray for all ISM partners around the world, that the Lord will strengthen, prosper, and increase them in every area. Declare that they step into a season of peace and prosperity, receiving divine wisdom, abundant resources, greater opportunities, and supernatural results as they support the work of the ministry. ', '9', 't', '2026-08-17 17:45:22.830664+00', '2026-08-17 17:45:22.830664+00', 'f')
