Warm greetings to all esteemed leaders and ministers of the Gospel. We are honored and grateful to have you join us for this prayer session.', '[{"body": "Pray for righteousness, peace and salvation to the ends of the earth, that the Lord''s will be manifested in the nations of the world. Declare that leaders are yielded to the Word of God, making decisions and policies that favour the gospel of Christ.\nDeclare, cutting off all evil influences over leaders, affirming that all rulers submit to the lordship of Christ and the light of God''s Word shines brightly throughout the whole world and darkness cannot comprehend it. Hallelujah.\nDeclare for India that the light of the Gospel shines brightly across the nation. Pray that hearts are turned unto the Lord in true repentance, embracing righteousness and a new life in Christ. Pray also for China, that it is delivered from injustice and every form of oppression. Declare that the power of God prevails in every sector of the nation — government, economy, and society — bringing righteousness, equity, and divine order.", "time": "00:00 AM to 00:09 AM GMT+1", "focus": "Pray for the peace of the nations, especially China, India and salvation of leaders.", "label": "Prayer Point 1", "scripture": "1 Timothy 2:1–2 (KJV) “I exhort therefore, that, first of all, supplications, prayers, intercessions, and giving of thanks, be made for all men; For kings, and for all that are in authority; that we may lead a quiet and peaceable life in all godliness and honesty.”"}, {"body": "Pray effectively, lifting up the youth and teens of this generation before the Lord, that their eyes of understanding be enlightened, that they may know the Lord and walk in the fullness of His purpose for their lives. Causing His light to shine brightly in their hearts, dispelling every form of darkness, confusion, and deception. Granting them wisdom, knowledge, and spiritual understanding to make the right choices that align with God''s perfect will.\nDeclare supernatural progression in every area of their lives — academically, spiritually, mentally, and socially. They move forward with clarity, excellence, and divine direction. Their paths shine brighter and brighter, leading them into greater glory and impact.", "time": "00:10 AM to 00:19 AM GMT+1", "focus": "Pray for enlightenment in the hearts of youth and teens of this generation.", "label": "Prayer Point 2", "scripture": "Ephesians 1:17–18 – “…that the God of our Lord Jesus Christ… may give unto you the spirit of wisdom and revelation… the eyes of your understanding being enlightened…”\n1 Timothy 4:12–15 – “…be thou an example of the believers… Meditate upon these things… that thy profiting may appear to all.”"}, {"body": "Pray for ministers of the Gospel and their ministries all around the world. Declare supernatural advancement, unhindered growth, and limitless progress in every aspect of their calling and assignment.\nDeclare multiple grace upon them, causing their impact to increase and their influence to spread far and wide. Strengthen them with might by the Spirit in the inner man, that they may walk in boldness, wisdom, and divine direction at all times. Removing every barrier, limitation, and opposition that seeks to hinder their effectiveness.\nDecree that their ministries flourish like a well-watered garden, bearing abundant and lasting fruits of righteousness. Doors of utterance be opened continually, and the Word of God grow mightily and prevail through them. Causing them to move from glory to glory, fulfilling their divine mandate with excellence and power. Thank the Lord for His Spirit at work in them, producing outstanding results and establishing their works in righteousness, in Jesus'' Name. Amen.", "time": "00:20 AM to 00:29 AM GMT+1", "focus": "Pray for ministers and their ministries that they progress without limitation.", "label": "Prayer Point 3", "scripture": "2 Thessalonians 3:1 – “Pray for us, that the word of the Lord may run swiftly, and be glorified…”\nPhilippians 1:12 – “…the things which happened unto me have fallen out rather unto the furtherance of the gospel.”"}, {"body": "Pray for the mighty success of the ongoing ISM Ministers'' and Leaders'' Conferences. Declaring that the presence of God be powerfully manifested in every session, bringing divine wisdom, insight, and transformation to all who attend.\nDeclare that every minister and leader will be empowered, refreshed, and equipped for greater works. As there will be an outpouring of the Spirit, resulting in growth, unity, supernatural advancement and progression in every area of ministry.\nProclaim that the conferences will be a resounding success in every city, nation, country, or region that it holds — touching lives and advancing the work of the Kingdom mightily.", "time": "00:30 AM to 00:39 AM GMT+1", "focus": "Pray for the mighty success of the ongoing ISM Ministers and Leaders Conferences.", "label": "Prayer Point 4", "scripture": "Zechariah 4:6 – “Not by might nor by power, but by my Spirit,” says the Lord Almighty.\nEphesians 4:11–12 – “…He gave some to be apostles… pastors and teachers, for the equipping of the saints…”"}]', 'Prophecies, testimonies, & exaltations. Inspirations from the August 2026 Global Communion Service and the HSLHS with Pastor Chris.
