  ('a28eddac-d22e-416f-8a40-2db2d3b153f6', '2026-09-07', 'PRAYER POINTS FOR THE WEEK, STARTING MONDAY 7th SEPTEMBER, 2026.*', 'GLORY! GLORY! GLORY! WELCOME TO THE MONTH OF GROWTH! GROW, INCREASE, ENLARGE, EXPAND AND BECOME GREATER!
‎HALLELUJAH!.
‎Luke 2:40 (KJV) “And the child grew, and waxed strong in spirit, filled with wisdom: and the grace of God was upon him.

Firstly, we express our profound gratitude to our dear Man of God, Rev. Dr. Chris Oyakhilome, DSC, DSC, DD—our model in following the Lord, our loving Father, and our mentor. Sir, we deeply appreciate and love you Sir.
‎We also extend our heartfelt appreciation to the Executive Minister of the Loveworod Ministry of Ministerial Leadership Development, highly esteemed Pastor Deola Phillips, and the Director of the International School of Ministry, highly esteemed Pastor Jummy Ola-akisanya. Thank you so much, for your unwavering dedication and for the remarkable impact you continually make in our lives through the ISM.
‎Warm greetings to all esteemed leaders and ministers of the Gospel. We are honored and grateful to have you join us for this prayer session.', '[{"body": "\n‎\n‎Pray for Pakistan and other nations affected by floods, landslides, earthquakes, storms, and other natural disasters. Intercede for divine protection, comfort, healing, and preservation of lives, especially for those in vulnerable and affected communities.\n‎Pray for the leaders of these nations to receive divine wisdom and direction as they coordinate rescue, relief, and restoration efforts. Declare that the Lord will strengthen the nations, bring help to those in distress, restore devastated communities, and cause peace, stability, and prosperity to prevail.\n‎", "time": "00:00 AM TO 00:09 AM GMT+1*", "focus": "*PRAY FOR THE NATIONS OF MEN AND THEIR LEADERS, ESPECIALLY NEPAL AND PAKISTAN.*", "label": "Prayer Point 1", "scripture": "  Psalm 147:3 (KJV): “He healeth the broken in heart, and bindeth up their wounds."}, {"body": "Pray for ministers of the Gospel around the world, that they be strengthened with might by the Holy Spirit, filled with wisdom, courage, and divine insight to effectively fulfil their God-given assignments. Pray that they remain steadfast in the Word, sensitive to the leading of the Spirit, and bold in proclaiming the Gospel with power, resulting in the salvation, transformation, and establishment of many in Christ. Pray for divine protection, provision, and grace upon ministers, their families, and ministries. Declare that their ministries experience supernatural growth, expansion, and greater global influence, with doors of opportunity opened for the Gospel in nations and communities. Pray that they continually abound in the work of the Lord, prevailing over every opposition and bringing forth lasting fruits to the glory of God.", "time": "00:10 AM to 00:19 AM GMT+1*", "focus": "FOR GROWTH, IMPACT AND STRENGTH FOR MINISTERS AROUND THE GLOBE.", "label": "Prayer Point 2", "scripture": "Galatians 5:22-23 says, ''But the fruit of the Spirit is love, joy, peace, longsuffering, gentleness, goodness, faith, Meekness, temperance: against such there is no law''.\n‎"}, {"body": "‎Pray for men and women around the world, whose hearts the Lord has stirred to fight in defense of justice, truth, the oppressed, and for God''s people and the churches of Christ. That they''ll be bold to stand firm, full of courage to do the Lord''s will, for His glory. The Lord make them victorious over all their adversaries in Jesus'' name. Amen.\n‎", "time": "00:20AM to 00:29AM*", "focus": "*PRAY FOR THOSE WHO STAND FIRM FOR TRUTH, JUSTICE, AND RIGHTEOUSNESS*", "label": "Prayer Point 3", "scripture": "2 Samuel 10:12 (NIV) Joab said to his brother Abishai, ''Be strong, and let us fight bravely for our people and the cities of our God. The LORD will do what is good in his sight''.\n‎"}, {"body": "Pray for every new partners raised and connected to our man of God and the ISM from every nation, with a commitment to advancing the Gospel and supporting the work of the ministry. Pray that together with the existing partners they will be strengthened, inspired, and increasingly effective in their partnership, giving and kingdom assignments. Declare that the Lord’s grace, wisdom, favor, and resources abound towards every partner, enabling them to fulfil their purpose and produce lasting results.", "time": "00:30 AM to 00:39 AM GMT+1*", "focus": "PRAY FOR THE GREATER EFFECTIVENESS AND KINGDOM IMPACT OF ISM PARTNERS WORLDWIDE.*", "label": "Prayer Point 4", "scripture": "2 Corinthians 9:6–8 (KJV) “But this I say, He which sowed sparingly shall reap also sparingly; and he which sowed bountifully shall reap also bountifully. Every man according as he purposeth in his heart, so let him give; not grudgingly, or of necessity: for God loves a cheerful giver. And God is able to make all grace abound toward you; that ye, always having all sufficiency in all things, may abound to every good work.”"}]', 'CONCLUSION:*
