  ('72e81316-e337-46be-9365-179783dd4785', '2026-08-31', 'PRAYER POINTS FOR THE WEEK, STARTING FROM MONDAY 24th- AUGUST, 2026.', 'IT IS STILL OUR MONTH OF PROGRESSION!!!

PROVERBS 4:25 (KJV): “LET THINE EYES LOOK RIGHT ON, AND LET THINE EYELIDS LOOK STRAIGHT BEFORE THEE.”

Firstly, we express our profound gratitude to our dear Man of God, Rev. Dr. Chris Oyakhilome, DSC, DSC, DD—our perfect example in following the Lord, our loving Father, and our mentor. Sir, we deeply appreciate and love you.', '[{"body": "Pray for supernatural progress, advancement, peace, stability, and prosperity, rising above every limitation, stagnation, and retrogression in every nation and the light of God’s word shines brighter in the nations of the world.\n\nPray for wisdom and divine guidance for leaders at every level to make decisions that promote righteousness, justice, peace, and the well-being of their people, advancing good governance, education, healthcare, technology, innovation, infrastructure, and sustainable development.\n\nPray against war, terrorism, violence, political instability, corruption, poverty, economic hardship, division, and social unrest, and declare that peace and stability reign within every nation.\n\n", "time": "00:00 AM TO 00:09 AM GMT+1", "focus": "PRAY FOR THE PEACE AND PROGRESSION IN EVERY NATION.", "label": "Prayer Point 1", "scripture": "\n\n\nJeremiah 29:7 (KJV) And seek the peace of the city whither I have caused you to be carried away captives, and pray unto the LORD for it: for in the peace thereof shall ye have peace.\n"}, {"body": "Pray for ministers of the Gospel around the world, that they will experience divine peace, supernatural prosperity, continuous advancement, and abundant grace in every area of their lives and ministries. Declare that they are strengthened by the Spirit of God, renewed in their commitment to the Gospel, and equipped with wisdom, knowledge, and spiritual understanding to fulfil their divine assignments effectively. Pray that every minister will walk in God''s perfect will and experience greater dimensions of grace, favour, influence, and impact.\n", "time": " 00:10 AM to 00:19 AM GMT+1", "focus": " PRAY FOR PEACE, PROSPERITY AND ADVANCEMENT OF MINISTERS AND THE PROLIFERATION OF THEIR MINISTRIES", "label": "Prayer Point 2", "scripture": "Isaiah 54:2–3 (KJV) Enlarge the place of thy tent, and let them stretch forth the curtains of thine habitations: spare not, lengthen thy cords, and strengthen thy stakes;\n\nFor thou shalt break forth on the right hand and on the left; and thy seed shall inherit the Gentiles, and make the desolate cities to be inhabited."}, {"body": "\nDeclare abundance of resources for the ISM Ministers and Leaders Conferences all around the world in Jesus Name. Affirm that every resource needed comes free course unhindered by the power of the Spirit in Jesus Name. Amen!", "time": "00:20 to 00:29* GMT+1", "focus": "DECLARE ABUNDANCE AND OVERFLOW OF FINANCES AND RESOURCES FOR THE ISM MINISTERS AND LEADERS CONFERENCE ALL AROUND THE WORLD", "label": "Prayer Point 3", "scripture": "Deuteronomy 33:19 - They shall call the people unto the mountain; there they shall offer sacrifices of righteousness: for they shall suck of the abundance of the seas, and of treasures hid in the sand.\n\nIsaiah 60:5 - Then thou shalt see, and flow together, and thine heart shall fear, and be enlarged; because the abundance of the sea shall be converted unto thee, the forces of the Gentiles shall come unto thee."}, {"body": "Give God thanks and praise for the financial partners of the International School of Ministry around the world; we’ll proclaim the Lord’s supernatural blessings upon them, declaring a great financial harvest of abundance and overflow for every partner.\n\nPray that circumstances are divinely aligned to favor each of them, and that more financial laborers join forces with the man of God to expand the vision of the International School of Ministry.\n", "time": "00:30 AM to 00:39 AM GMT+1 ", "focus": "PRAY FOR ALL THE FINANCIAL PARTNERS OF THE INTERNATIONAL SCHOOL OF MINISTRY", "label": "Prayer Point 4", "scripture": "\n\n2 Corinthians: 9:10: (TLB): “For God, who gives seed to the farmer to plant, and later on good crops to harvest and eat, will give you more and more seed to plant and will make it grow so that you can give away more and more fruit from your harvest.”\n\nLuke 6:38 : “Give, and it shall be given unto you; good measure, pressed down, and shaken together, and running over, shall men give into your bosom...”"}]', '1. Prophecies, testimonies, & exaltations. Inspirations from the 2026 Global Ministers’ Classroom and Praise Night with Pastor Chris.

2. Rhapsody Devotion - 00:50 am

3. Book review- joint this chariot

4. Announcements - 00: 55 am

5. Offering and tithe

6. Reiteration of instructions to those joining for the first and those requiring counseling

7. Appreciation

8. Benediction', 'PROGRESSION', ' JUDE 1:20 AMPC: “But you, beloved, build yourselves up [founded] on your most holy faith [make progress, rise like an edifice higher and higher], praying in the Holy Spirit.”)
', 'Precious Father, how you have loved me unconditionally! I trust in Your love and walk in the light of it today as You’re in the light. Hence, I know there’s therefore now no condemnation for me! I belong to You forever. I rejoice to know that You chose me to express Yourself and reveal Your personality and glory in me! I live today and everyday to bring glory to Your Name by manifesting Your grace and displaying Your virtues, and perfections. Thank You, for raising me up and making me to sit together in heavenly places in Christ! Not only does Christ live in me, I’m in Christ, and I function from the heavenly realms of glory, as the heavenly man in Christ. Hallelujah.


The wisdom of God is at work in me, guiding me and showing me the way to go.

Christ has been made wisdom unto me; therefore, I conduct all my affairs with prudence and discretion. I have insight into mysteries and secrets, and the Spirit of wisdom reveals hidden things unto me! Lord, I thank You for Your divine power that’s at work in me today mightily; I’m full of that divine might today, even by the Spirit of God! Thus I’m energized for the supernatural and enabled to live the glorious life, and accomplish my everyday tasks in Jesus’ Name. Amen.
