  ('46929857-2e03-454b-bfa3-f05b8c0f1f9c', '2026-09-21', 'PRAYER POINTS FOR THE WEEK, STARTING MONDAY 21st  SEPTEMBER, 2026.', 'GROWTH IS NOT A SECRET; IT IS THE PRODUCT OF REVELATION, RIGHT APPLICATION, AND CONSISTENT PRACTICE OF GOD’S PRINCIPLES. AMEN!  WE ARE IN OUR BEAUTIFUL MONTH OF GROWTH! 
‎Colossians 1:10 (KJV) “That ye might walk worthy of the Lord unto all pleasing, being fruitful in every good work, and increasing in the knowledge of God.”
‎', '[{"body": "                                                                                                                                                                                                        \n‎Pray for the nations of the world, their leaders, and governing authorities, that they will be guided by divine wisdom, justice, righteousness, and truth in the formulation and implementation of laws and policies.\n‎Pray against the enactment or misuse of hate-speech policies and laws in ways that could unjustly restrict lawful expression, silence the proclamation of the Gospel, or hinder the free exercise of faith. Declare that every policy that contradicts righteousness, justice, and fundamental freedoms is overturned, while laws that promote peace, dignity, and the wellbeing of all people are established. Declare that the Gospel continues to have free course and be glorified in every nation, and that Christians everywhere are granted boldness to preach Christ openly and without unlawful hindrance.", "time": "00:00 AM TO 00:09 AM GMT+1       ", "focus": "‎PRAY FOR THE NATIONS AND FOR FREEDOM OF EXPRESSION     ", "label": "Prayer Point 1", "scripture": "\n2 Thessalonians 3:2 (KJV): “And that we may be delivered from unreasonable and wicked men: for all men have not faith.”"}, {"body": "                                                        \n‎Pray earnestly in tongues of the Spirit, and in accordance with the verses of Scripture above, for ministers of the gospel and Christian associations around the world. ", "time": "00:10 AM to 00:19 AM GMT+1   ", "focus": " PRAYER FOR EVERY MINISTER OF THE GOSPEL.             ", "label": "Prayer Point 2", "scripture": "2 Thessalonians 3:1-3 says, ‘Finally, brethren, pray for us, that the word of the Lord may have free course, and be glorified, even as it is with you: And that we may be delivered from unreasonable and wicked men: for all men have not faith. But the Lord is faithful, who shall establish you, and keep you from evil’."}, {"body": "                                                                                                                                                               \nPray for young people around the world, declaring God’s protection, health, wisdom, and salvation over them. Pray specially for those who are sick among God’s people, that they receive healing, strength, and restoration through the power of the Holy Spirit. Pray for an increased measure of God’s grace upon young adults and children throughout the world. Declare that they are strengthened, established, and increasing in the knowledge of God, walking in faith, love, unity, and the power of the Spirit.", "time": " 00:20AM to 00:29AM", "focus": "PRAY FOR HEALING, WISDOM AND DIVINE PRESERVATION FOR CHILDREN AND YOUNG ADULTS.               ", "label": "Prayer Point 3", "scripture": "2 Corinthians 12:9 (KJV) “And he said unto me, my grace is sufficient for thee: for my strength is made perfect in weakness.”\n‎"}, {"body": "                                             \n‎\n‎Pray in Spirit, and for the body of Christ the world over, that they may walk in the unity of the Spirit and with a united front, stronger and stronger as we strive for the faith of the gospel, eagerly awaiting the coming of our Lord and Savior Jesus Christ. Pray that the ongoing ISM Ministers and leaders conferences around the world will further strengthen, unite and beautified God''s people. Amen. ", "time": "00:30 AM to 00:39 AM GMT+1  ", "focus": "    ISM MINISTERS AND LEADERS CONFERENCE: PRAY FOR UNITY, STRENGTH AND EXPANSION TO THE BODY OF CHRIST ALL AROUND THE WORLD.", "label": "Prayer Point 4", "scripture": "Ephesians 4:1-6 says, ‘I therefore, the prisoner of the Lord, beseech you that ye walk worthy of the vocation wherewith ye are called, With all lowliness and meekness, with longsuffering, forbearing one another in love; Endeavoring to keep the unity of the Spirit in the bond of peace. There is one body, and one Spirit, even as ye are called in one hope of your calling; One Lord, one faith, one baptism, One God and Father of all, who is above all, and through all, and in you all’.\n‎"}]', '. Prophecies, testimonies, & exaltations. Inspirations from the PRAISE NIGHT with Pastor Chris and Monthly Cell leaders training with highly esteemed Executive Minister. 
‎2. Rhapsody Devotion - 00:50 am
‎3. Book review: 7 Spirits of God. 
‎4. Announcements - 00: 55 am
‎5. Offering and tithe
‎6. Reiteration of instructions to those joining for the first and those requiring counseling
‎7. Appreciation
‎8. Benediction', 'GROWTH  SCRIPTURE: ', 'Luke 2:52 NIV)*- And Jesus grew in wisdom and stature, and in favor with God and men', '
