  ('ce05ea0b-b4a3-4f13-aa19-1aaa75388712', '2026-09-29', 'PRAYER POINTS FOR THE WEEK STARTING MONDAY 28TH, SEPTEMBER, 2026.', 'GROWTH IS OUR NEW REALITY!
‎
‎Our capacity is increasing, our influence is expanding, and our impact is multiplying. Prepare for more!
