', '[{"body": "                                                                                                              1\n‎Pray for the nations and their leaders, that God’s wisdom, righteousness, and counsel will guide every decision and policy that affects the people. Pray that leaders will receive divine direction to govern with justice, integrity, and compassion.\n‎Declare that the purposes of God will prevail in every nation, and that every policy, law, and decision contrary to God’s will shall be overturned. Pray for peace, stability, and prosperity across nations, and that the Gospel will have free course, bringing salvation, righteousness, and transformation to every people.\n", "time": "00:00 AM TO 00:09 AM GMT+1                                                                ", "focus": "NATIONS AND THEIR LEADERS. ", "label": "Prayer Point 1", "scripture": "Timothy 2-2:1: I exhort therefore, that, first of all, supplications, prayers, intercessions, and giving of thanks, be made for all men; For kings, and for all that are in authority; that we may lead a quiet and peaceable life in all godliness and honesty."}, {"body": "‎Pray for every minister to experience continual spiritual growth, increased grace, wisdom, strength, and effectiveness in their calling. Pray that their ministries will flourish, expand their reach, and produce lasting results as they faithfully fulfil God’s purpose.\n‎Declare that their influence will increase, their impact will multiply, and their ministries will continually advance, reaching more lives with the Gospel and bringing glory to God.\n‎\n", "time": "00:10 AM to 00:19 AM GMT+1      ", "focus": "PRAY FOR INCREASED GROWTH FOR MINISTERS AND THEIR MINISTRIES.                                   ", "label": "Prayer Point 2", "scripture": " 2 Peter 3:18 — “But grow in grace, and in the knowledge of our Lord and Saviour Jesus Christ…”"}, {"body": "                                                                                                                                                                          Interceding for many around the world suffering from vaccine-related injuries and ailments; pray that God’s grace will be poured out upon them for healing and restoration. Also pray and declare that voices of truth – individuals and organizations fighting for the right causes in nations- will be heard, and evil agendas stopped, in Jesus '' name. Amen.\n", "time": "00:20AM to 00:29AM    ", "focus": "PRAY FOR THOSE AFFECTED BY VACCINES AND THE ADVANCEMENT OF TRUTH.            ", "label": "Prayer Point 3", "scripture": "Psalms 107:17-20 says, “Fools because of their transgression, and because of their iniquities, are afflicted. Their soul abhorreth all manner of meat; And they draw near unto the gates of death. Then they cry unto the LORD in their trouble, And he saveth them out of their distresses. He sent his word, and healed them, and delivered them from their destructions.”\n‎"}, {"body": "‎Pray fervently in the Spirit, declaring that the gospel will be fully preached and established throughout your nation and your catchments by the mighty power of God’s Spirit.  Give thanks to the Lord for the many opportunities He is opening for rapid spread of the gospel, leading to the fulfillment of His work. Also declare the endless increase of Christ’s rule, dominion, and peace over nations and cities of the world. Amen!\n\n", "time": "", "focus": "PRAY FOR AN UNSTOPPABLE SPREAD OF THE GOSPEL IN YOUR NATION THROUGH THE UPCOMING HEALING STREAMS LIVE HEALING SERVICE.", "label": "Prayer Point 4", "scripture": "\n‎Matthew 24:14 (KJV) ''And this gospel of the kingdom shall be preached in all the world for a witness unto all nations; and then shall the end come''."}]', 'CONCLUSION:
‎1. Prophecies, testimonies, & exaltations. Inspirations from the Global Prayer and Fasting with Pastor Chris and Monthly Cell leaders training with highly esteemed Executive Minister. 
‎2. Rhapsody Devotion - 00:50 am
‎3. Book review- How to make your faith work. 
‎4. Announcements - 00: 55 am
‎5. Offering and tithe
‎6. Reiteration of instructions to those joining for the first time and those requiring counseling
‎7. Appreciation
‎8. Benediction
', NULL, '‎(CONFESSION FOR THE DAY: CONFESSION GUIDE TOPIC: GROWTH SCRIPTURE READING) John 15:2 - Every branch in me that beareth not fruit he taketh away: and every branch that beareth fruit, he purgeth it, that it may bring forth more fruit.', 'This is my year of manifestation 
‎This is my month of Growth!    I affirm that the eyes of my understanding are enlightened by the Spirit of God through the knowledge of God’s Word, to see and receive every good thing that God has made available unto me in Christ Jesus. The Spirit of God has set me on the path of life; therefore, I walk each day in the reality of my inheritance in Christ! I do not go up to come down in life. For my path is as the shining light that shines brighter and brighter unto the perfect day. I am not where I used to be; I’ve gained the speed of the Spirit. I’m in the center of God’s will for my life. Hallelujah.
