  ('a5ae62c8-22ea-4303-b5dc-368fd4882689', '2026-10-12', 'PRAYER POINTS FOR THE WEEK STARTING MONDAY 12TH OCTOBER, 2026.', '
‎ISAIAH 49:15 (KJV) “CAN A WOMAN FORGET HER SUCKING CHILD, THAT SHE SHOULD NOT HAVE COMPASSION ON THE SON OF HER WOMB? YEA, THEY MAY FORGET, YET WILL I NOT FORGET THEE.” YOU WILL EXPERIENCE THE VISCERAL COMPASSION OF GOD IN THE NAME OF OUR LORD JESUS, AMEN. GLORY TO GOD!', '[{"body": "\n‎Pray for kings, presidents and those in positions of authority, that they will receive divine wisdom to govern with justice, integrity and understanding, making decisions that promote peace, stability and the well-being of their nations.\n‎", "time": "00:00 AM TO 00:09 AMGMT+1 ", "focus": "PRAY FOR RIGHTEOUS LEADERSHIP IN THE NATIONS.", "label": "Prayer Point 1", "scripture": "‎Proverbs 21:1 (KJV) “The king''s heart is in the hand of the LORD, as the rivers of water: he turneth it whithersoever he will.”"}, {"body": "‎Pray that ministers will receive clear direction, divine wisdom and understanding from the Holy Spirit as they lead their ministries. Pray that they will discern God’s purpose accurately and make decisions that advance the Gospel and produce lasting impact.", "time": "00:10 AM to 00:19 AM GMT+1", "focus": "‎PRAY FOR DIVINE DIRECTION AND WISDOM FOR MINISTERS.", "label": "Prayer Point 2", "scripture": "‎Isaiah 30:21 (KJV) “And thine ears shall hear a word behind thee, saying, This is the way, walk ye in it...”"}, {"body": "‎Intercede specially for the lost in our world, that they be turned from darkness to light and from the power of Satan unto God, through the ministries and activities of the Saints for the upcoming Healing streams. Amen.", "time": "00:20AM to 00:29AM", "focus": " PRAY FOR SALVATION OF SOULS THOUGH THE UPCOMING HEALING STREAMS LIVE HEALING SERVICES WITH PASTOR CHRIS.", "label": "Prayer Point 3", "scripture": "‎Isaiah 45:8 says, Drop down, ye heavens, from above, and let the skies pour down righteousness: let the earth open, and let them bring forth salvation, and let righteousness spring up together; I the LORD have created it’."}, {"body": "‎Pray for the effective coordination and operation of every ISM pastors, ministries, minister, and prayer group, that all preparations and mobilization efforts will be carried out with excellence and that the Healing Streams Live Healing Service will have a far-reaching impact through the International school of Ministry", "time": "00:30 AM to 00:39 AM * ", "focus": "*PRAY FOR THE EFFECTIVE OPERATION OF THE ISM MINISTERS TOWARDS THE UPCOMING HEALING STREAMS LIVE HEALING SERVICE WITH PASTOR CHRIS", "label": "Prayer Point 4", "scripture": ". Colossians 4:17 — “Take heed to the ministry which thou hast received in the Lord, that thou fulfil it.”"}]', 'CONCLUSION
