  ('fc9c2b4c-f381-4aff-ba69-3b3b49a24307', '2026-10-19', '‎PRAYER POINTS FOR THE WEEK: STARTING MONDAY 19TH OCTOBER, 2026.', '‎Psalms 100:5 says, for the lord is good; his mercy is everlasting; and his truth endureth to all generations.

‎YOU AND YOUR MINISTRY WILL EXPERIENCE THE VISCERAL COMPASSION OF GOD IN THE NAME OF OUR LORD JESUS, AMEN. GLORY TO GOD!', '[{"body": "\n‎\n‎\n‎Pray for the nations of the world that the Gospel gains unprecedented access especially in Pakistan, that ministers are strengthened and protected as they preach the Word, and that the hearts of people are open to the message of salvation.\n‎\n‎Declare that the light of Christ shines brightly throughout the nations, bringing salvation and transformation to countless lives.\n‎\n", "time": "00:00AM to 00:09 AM GMT+1", "focus": "PRAY FOR PEACE AND THE SPREAD OF THE GOSPEL IN NATIONS, ESPECIALLY IN PAKISTAN", "label": "Prayer Point 1", "scripture": "\n\n2 Thessalonians 3:1 — “Pray for us, that the word of the Lord may have free course, and be glorified...”"}, {"body": "\n\n\n\nThank God specifically for ministers organizing crusades and outreaches in preparation for the upcoming Healing Streams Live Healing Services with Pastor Chris. Declare that they are strengthened and guided by the Holy Spirit. Declare that their efforts produce a great harvest of souls and that countless lives are positioned for miracles, healing, and transformation at the Healing Streams.\n‎\n", "time": "00:10AM to 00:19AM GMT+1", "focus": "PRAY FOR MINISTERS ORGANIZING CRUSADES AND OUTREACHES IN PREPARATION FOR THE HEALING STREAMS LIVE HEALING SERVICES WITH PASTOR CHRIS.", "label": "Prayer Point 2", "scripture": "Acts 2:17 NIV. “In the last days, God says, I will pour out my Spirit on all people. Your sons and daughters will prophesy, your young men will see visions, your old men will dream dreams.\n"}, {"body": "\n\n\n\n‎Thank God for the mighty move of His Spirit through the translators of the Healing Streams Live Healing Services with Pastor Chris. Declare that every language is a powerful channel for the Word, breaking barriers and reaching billions across the earth. Pray that all translations are divinely accurate and powered by the Holy Spirit. Declare that no viewer or listener will be hindered by language. The healing mandate and salvation will penetrate hearts in every tongue and dialect, bringing forth miracles and an outpouring of the Spirit in every nation.\n", "time": "00:20AM to 00:29AM", "focus": "PRAY FOR LANGUAGES AND TRANSLATIONS IMPACT AT THE OCTOBER HEALING STREAMS LIVE HEALING SERVICES.", "label": "Prayer Point 3", "scripture": "‎Revelation 7:9 NIV “After this I looked, and there before me was a great multitude that no one could count, from every nation, tribe, people and language, standing before the throne and before the Lamb…”.\n"}, {"body": "\n\n\n‎Thank God for the Healing of ministers of the gospel around the world. Declare that God''s people are healed, strengthened and divinely restored. Pray that the presence of the Holy Spirit fills their souls, renew their strength and that their testimonies of the message of divine healing, health and eternal life, spreads rapidly, drawing multitudes from cities, villages, and nations, to witness and testify of the Lord’s mighty power.\n‎\n", "time": "00:30AM to 00:39AM", "focus": "PRAY AND THANK GOD FOR THE HEALING OF MINISTERS WHO ARE FACING HEALTH CHALLENGES AND SEVERE PAIN.", "label": "Prayer Point 4", "scripture": "\nMatthew 4:23 “And Jesus went about all Galilee, teaching in their synagogues, preaching the gospel of the kingdom, and healing all manner of sickness and all manner of disease among the people”.\n"}]', '‎CONCLUSION:
‎1. Prophecies, testimonies, & exaltations. Inspirations from the Global Communion Service with Pastor Chris and Monthly Cell leaders training with highly esteemed Executive Minister.
‎
‎2. Rhapsody Devotion - 00:50 am
‎3. Book review- Seven Spirits of God
‎4. Announcements - 00: 55 am
‎5. Offering and tithe
‎6. Reiteration of instructions to those joining for the first time and those requiring counselling
‎7. Appreciation
‎8. Benediction', ' 𝗙𝗜𝗡𝗔NCIAL GRACE.', '‎
‎SCRIPTURE READING: Genesis.12.2 - And I will make of thee a great nation, and I will bless thee, and make thy name great; and thou shalt be a blessing.', '‎


AFFIRMATIONS
‎I affirm that I am chosen for a life of fruitfulness and ever-increasing productivity. I am marked for success and victory; I HAVE A SPECIAL FINANCIAL GRACE!
‎I have grace for money, for riches, for wealth and fortunes. I am guaranteed of continued financial supplies; I am plugged to an unending supply of wealth and resources in Jesus Mighty Name. The Lord has blessed me with great financial capacity .Strangers are obligated to favour my financial increase because my promotion comes from God and not man. I celebrate the grace of God which causes His glory to be revealed in all that I do and usher me into my next level of greatness. Glory!Hallelujah!!!!!
‎
‎All the wealth in this world belongs to me, for I am an heir of God and a joint-heir with Christ.I am fulfilling God’s purpose and plan for my life, walking in paths that He’s arranged for me. He’s made all things I require for life and godliness available to me, and I celebrate the grace of prosperity and abundance that I enjoy as the seed of Abraham. The works of my hands are blessed and I am set on the path of permanent success and prosperity. I do not know when the heat comes, for I am fashioned to flourish like the cedar in Lebanon. Glory to God.
‎
‎I am a money man and the custodian of the Kingdom wealth; I am the light of the world, and by the Spirit, I touch lives, mend broken hearts, bring healing to the nations, and prosperity to those in need, all to the praise and glory of your Name. I''m self-sufficient, in all things, so much so that i require no aid or support. Hallelujah!
