  ('96439ad8-75f5-4d5b-937a-b70f7b6e235e', '2026-11-03', '‎PRAYER POINTS FOR THE WEEK, STARTING MONDAY 2ND NOVEMBER, 2026.', 'welcome to  November, our month of Comfort.
2 Corinthians 1:3 - Blessed be God, even the father of our Lord Jesus Christ, the father of mercies and the God of all comfort', '[{"body": "‎Pray for the peace of God to prevail across all nations of the world. Declare an end to wars, conflicts, violence, terrorism, civil unrest, and every form of instability. Pray for divine intervention in troubled nations, wisdom for world leaders, and the establishment of peace, unity, security, and prosperity among all peoples. declare that the nations are filled with the knowledge of God''s glory, and His righteousness prevails throughout the earth.\n‎", "time": "00:00 to 00:10 ", "focus": " PRAY FOR DIVINE PEACE ACROSS THE NATIONS OF THE WORLD.", "label": "Prayer Point 1", "scripture": "PSALM 46:9 (KJV) “He maketh wars to cease unto the end of the earth; he breaketh the bow, and cutteth the spear in sunder; he burneth the chariot in the fire.”"}, {"body": "‎Pray for ministers of the Gospel and their ministries around the world, that they excel without borders and make extraordinary impact through the power of God''s Word. Pray for increased grace, divine wisdom, spiritual understanding, boldness, and effectiveness in fulfilling their callings. Declare that the Word of God spreads rapidly and prevails in every nation, city, community, and territory. pray for increased influence, multiplied resources, and greater opportunities for ministers to reach more people with the Gospel, establish churches, raise disciples, and advance God''s Kingdom globally.\n‎", "time": "00:10 to 00:20", "focus": "PRAY FOR GLOBAL IMPACT AND EXPANSION OF MINISTERS AND THEIR MINISTRIES THROUGH THE WORD.", "label": "Prayer Point 2", "scripture": "\n‎2 Thessalonians 3:1 (KJV): “Finally, brethren, pray for us, that the word of the Lord may have free course, and be glorified, even as it is with you.”\n‎"}, {"body": "\n‎‎Pray, thanking the God for the extraordinary impact of the just-concluded Healing Streams Live Healing Services with Pastor Chris. Thank Him for the multitudes who received salvation, experienced divine healing, and encountered His transforming power. Pray for the preservation and establishment of every soul won, that they grow in the knowledge of God''s Word, become firmly rooted in the faith, and remain committed to the things of the Kingdom. declare that every healing testimony is permanent, every miracle is sustained, and the impact of the Healing Streams continues to produce lasting testimonies across the nations.\n‎\n", "time": "00:20 to 00:25", "focus": "PRAY, THANKING GOD FOR THE ESTABLISHMENT OF SOULS, PERMANENT HEALING AND SALVATION THROUGH THE JUST CONCLUDED HEALING STREAM.", "label": "Prayer Point 3", "scripture": "John 6:39 (KJV): “And this is the Father''s will which hath sent me, that of all which he hath given me I should lose nothing, but should raise it up again at the last day."}, {"body": " ‎Thank the lord for the tremendous global impact, remarkable victories, divine interventions, and outstanding accomplishments throughout the concluding ministry year. Specially thank Him for the significant progress made in our transition from functioning as an organization to functioning as a Kingdom, with a greater consciousness of our Kingdom identity, purpose, and divine mandate. Hallelujah! Thank God for ministry programs and services.\n‎Pray for the upcoming LoveWorld Expo and the International Pastors'' and Partners'' Conference (IPPC) programs, declaring a resounding success. Thank the Lord because every objective, instruction, and agenda of the Holy Spirit shall be fully accomplished. pray for divine coordination, excellence, massive participation, strategic connections, and extraordinary global impact. Every activity shall advance the vision of the ministry and bring greater glory to the Name of the Lord.", "time": "00:25 to 00:30 ", "focus": "PRAYER OF THANKSGIVING FOR MINISTRY PROGRAMS, NEW MINISTRY YEAR, FOR LOVEWORLD EXPO AND IPPC", "label": "Prayer Point 4", "scripture": "Proverbs 16:1-3 says “The preparations of the heart in man, and the answer of the tongue, is from the LORD. All the ways of a man are clean in his own eyes; but the LORD weighted the spirits. Commit thy works unto the LORD, and thy thoughts shall be established."}]', '‎CONCLUSION:
‎1. Prophecies, testimonies, & exaltations. Inspiration and Monthly Cell leaders training with highly esteemed Executive Minister.
‎2. Rhapsody Devotion - 00:50 am
‎3. Book review- HOW TO MAKE YOUR FAITH WORK
‎4. Announcements - 00: 55 am
‎5. Offering and tithe
‎6. Reiteration of instructions to those joining for the first time and those requiring counselling
‎7. Appreciation
‎8. Benediction
‎', 'KINGDOM EXPLOITS', 'Romans.14.17 - For the kingdom of God is not meat and drink; but righteousness, and peace, and joy in the Holy Ghost.', '‎AFFIRMATIONS
‎
‎This is my year of Manifestation
‎This is my month of Comfort!
‎I am comforted on all sides!
‎I affirm that I am a custodian of kingdom wealth. Money answers to me. I do not live by the systems of this world; I function by heaven’s economy. My increase is independent of inflation, downturns, or currency fluctuations. I am plugged into divine abundance and my supply is endless. I’m led by the Spirit in financial matters. I make sound decisions, execute divine strategies, and attract the right opportunities always.
‎
‎Wealth is not coming; wealth is here—in me, with me, and flowing through me. The blessing of the Lord makes rich and adds no sorrow with it. I do not labor in vain, neither do I cast my seed into dry ground. I sow in the Spirit and I reap bountifully. I am a cheerful giver and my harvests are perpetual.
‎
‎I refuse the mindset of poverty. I refuse to think small, act small, or expect little. I think in the largeness of God, for He delights in my prosperity. I am a city set on a hill, a channel of financial blessings to generations. The wisdom of God guides me into profitable ventures and divine partnerships.
‎
‎Every day, my wealth multiplies. I’m increasing in assets, real estate, resources, influence, and financial favor. I have gold as dust and silver in plenty. Angels of money and harvest are working for me now. I call in resources from the north, south, east, and west. I live in financial rest and I function in financial dominion. Blessed be God. Hallelujah!
