  ('5a69c9d7-da60-4027-b70d-c0c4e9798659', 'Marriage and family Restoration', 'I am writing to humbly request your urgent prayer agreement and spiritual reinforcement. Pastors Michael and MaryAnne are currently navigating an intense spiritual battle surrounding the full restoration of our marriage after divorce, as well as the peace and alignment of our blended family—Sade, Christopher, Shanelle, Quaid, and Caleb.
