Iam Pastor John.S from Andhra Pradesh, India. I had been suffering from allergy since 10 years. I don''t use medicine on a regular basis, but only when it is necessary. 

 On the 1st of March around 2 pm I was at home and suddenly couldn''t breathe properly, I could hardly breathe. I realised that it''s a demonic attack, I told my wife to call esteemed minister Sheby, who is my Cell leader . 
She prayed over me in tongues and declared healing with divine authority and also made me to speak divine confessions. It took about 27 minutes...

 While min.Sheby is speaking the words of Life over me,  phlegm  came out from my throat and I was healed and delivered from the spirit of death. 

Glory to the Lord!
  I thank the ISM Prayer  platform where we are tought the Word of God, the Rhapsody of realities and the right use of words. 
I thank esteemed minister Sheby , through her  intervention and fearless stand against the attack of the enemy , I was delivered. 

I thank man of God for his priceless teachings of the eternal Truths. 

Also I thank the highly esteemed director for the extraordinary vision of ISM, which gave me this awesome opportunity to have a testimony and share it.

Thank you ISM!', 'Sheby Valentine ', 'India.', '59e1645b-6c02-4935-a1ed-1aed4fe52140', NULL, 't', '2026-04-03 12:04:40.257754+00', NULL),
  ('5f4ebc87-8e1a-45e9-ab59-98445f814479', 'Delivered from from financial troubles to the glorious liberty of kingdom Prosperity', 'Glory be to God!
My name is Hannah Tennyson from Chennai, India. 

When I was introduced to ISM by my then neighbour min Sheby, my husband and I were in a very painful financial situation due to the loss in his business during the covid period. The loans taken for the business were surmounting debts and causing a lot of financial & emotional suffering. At that time min Sheby asked me to listen to the messages of Pastor Chris Tithes and first fruits, where he spoke about giving the Tithes & first fruit to the Lord.

I believed and  started giving my first fruit offerings as well. And the Lord helped us to pay off the loans etc. However a few years later, when my husband wanted to restart the business I was petrified.  I remembered the past and didn''t have the strength to face any further failure and financial burdens. I reached out to the senior Cell Leader min.Sheby for counsel and prayer. She counselled me to be bold and to support my husband, she also connected me to our group Cell Leader Pastor Ronald, who further  helped me & my husband with the right materials to read.  As I kept sowing my seed offering in ISM I saw the Lords favour in my life. I decided to take a portion out of whatever money my husband would give me and offer it as the first & best fruit offering on his behalf .
  I started seeing Gods favour upon his work. Long story short, in just 2 years of starting the business, the govt of India has shown interest in his product, over other competitors from home and abroad. Now we are in the process of getting the paper work done for the final contract. Glory to God!
Through it all my husband has come to understand the Lord personally and his fervour for the Lord has increased.

I testify of the Manifestation of the Word of God in my life.
Proverbs 3:9-10 KJV — Honour the LORD with thy substance, and with the firstfruits of all thine increase: So shall thy barns be filled with plenty, and thy presses shall burst out with new wine.

Glory to God! 

My cup runneth over and the goodness & mercy of the Lord follows me all the days of my life.

I want to thank the man of God Pastor Chris for his unwavering dedication and commitment to the Preaching of the Gospel of which I too am a beneficiary.', 'Sheby Valentine', 'Chennai, India', '59e1645b-6c02-4935-a1ed-1aed4fe52140', NULL, 'f', '2026-11-11 15:01:07.78099+00', NULL)
