My name is Evg. Mathew, and I serve with Revival Prayer Ministries in Coimbatore, India.

We are involved in prayer ministry, evangelism, village outreach, deliverance, healing, discipleship and equipping believers. We have a desire to connect with pastors and ministry leaders from different nations for prayer, fellowship, encouragement and Kingdom collaboration.

I came across the Ministers prayer network and was very encouraged by your vision of bringing pastoral leaders together in authentic spiritual and relational unity.

